                                                "text": "credible alibi"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9adcf46-003c-4302-b606-9b2d5799dcb8",
                                                "sense_id": "c0feff32-cce5-3144-8ba1-3f9eb455c190",
                                                "text": "think up a credible excuse"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba52706f-d569-471f-8f8b-175255bd7477",
                                                "sense_id": "c0feff32-cce5-3144-8ba1-3f9eb455c190",
                                                "text": "While WMRE makes clear that electrification is the only credible option to decarbonise, it says that bi-mode trains could be used in the interim."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f01da410-58c0-4448-a8f1-86887f908983",
                                                "sense_id": "c0feff32-cce5-3144-8ba1-3f9eb455c190",
                                                "text": "What society classifies as “credible” is almost always a product of whichever social demographic happens to be economically dominant at the time of the classification."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a24f45bd-2152-3275-9258-b514bc651eb3",
                                        "entry_id": "91f55d3d-65a6-3e01-8e86-8ca2d8fe4f21",
